; The residence is a ZK factor WITHOUT REVEALING ALL, an ordinary factor, so
; its value is typed: the number 5 is not a String. The hidden income, declared
; before it and also of the wrong type here, is removed before typing, so the
; first ill-typed factor reported is the residence.
(scenario hidden_visible_ill_typed
  (spec "examples/core/core_hidden.triel")
  (entry "2026-05-01T00:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data (income (str "unknown")) (residence (int 5)) (loan_granted (bool false)))))
